"A short one-line description shown in application menus and package "
"managers.\n"
"\n"
"Keep it concise — typically under 80 characters."

#
# File: usr/share/appimage-creator/utils/tooltip_helper.py, line: 72
msgid ""
"Enable this for CLI tools that need a terminal to run.\n"
"\n"
"When enabled, the desktop environment will open a terminal emulator before "
"launching the application."
